### Register
POST {{MVP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teszt Elek",
  "email": "teszt@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "acceptTerms": true,
  "acceptPrivacy": true
}

### Login
POST {{MVP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teszt@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Current user
GET {{MVP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project
POST {{MVP_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Portfólió weboldal",
  "description": "Első projekt",
  "startDate": "2026-06-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-20",
  "dailyHours": 2,
  "status": "planned",
  "priority": "high"
}

### List projects
GET {{MVP_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
